    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.8 - Solid Manipulation. Spells for warming, heating, cooling, chilling and melting stone/metal/solid material, extending cracks and crumbling material, breaking wood/metal/locks, creating doorways through solid material, molding solids like clay, and transmuting solid material. Special Notes: See Section 15.7 (p. 97) for notes on construction and destruction of solid materials.",
